Package: msamodel
Type: Package
Title: Mutation-Stability-Activity Model of Neutral Structural Evolution
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Julian Echave
Maintainer: Julian Echave <jechave@unsam.edu.ar>
Description: Implementation of the Mutation-Stability-Activity (MSA) model for
    predicting site-specific structural divergence in protein evolution from
    single-point-mutation scans (SPMs). Provides Bayesian parameter estimation,
    prediction of divergence profiles under mutation-only and selection-only
    model variants, and a site-level (phi) decomposition of evolutionary
    constraint contributions.
